FILE: intent.py
PURPOSE: Classifies user query into one of 6 intents using keyword matching first, LLM fallback.
IMPORTS: json, enum, dictionary, llm

CLASSES:
  QueryIntent(Enum)
    ANSWER_ONLY | ANSWER_WITH_CHART | ANSWER_WITH_INSIGHTS |
    ANSWER_WITH_CHART_AND_INSIGHTS | WRITE | CLEANSE

FUNCTIONS:
  classify_intent(query, schema_summary="") -> QueryIntent
    Fast path: checks _CLEANSE_KEYWORDS → _WRITE_PHRASES → _CHART_KEYWORDS → else calls LLM.

  classify_intent_with_llm(query, schema_summary="") -> QueryIntent
    Sends query + schema to LLM, parses JSON response into QueryIntent.
